{
  "_comment": "English names in the inbox: personal papers by the name of a file or folder (tax returns, payslips, bank statements, identity papers, medical records: sent to _to_delete unopened; not the bare word 'passport'), and words of hidden text aimed at an AI. The folders of a kit of a national standard (kit_*) are a Russian registry's: none here. ai_phrases: phrases of a text addressed to an AI assistant (the search marks a fragment that has one). admin_*: the administrative pages a file of only such pages is set aside for (intake/admin_filter.py); no order of entry into force or payment order words are common enough in English papers to name, so the lists are shorter. admin_costs: prices of materials, equipment and works with an amount make a file substantive; admin_drawing: a drawing with an approval stamp is no cover page. admin_contract_keep: a contract with a scope of work or technical requirements is substantive.",
  "suspect_words": [
    "ignore",
    "instructions?",
    "assistant",
    "prompt",
    "system",
    "claude",
    "chatgpt",
    "llm"
  ],
  "ai_phrases": [
    "\\b(?:ignore|disregard|forget)\\b(?:\\W+\\w+){0,3}?\\W+(?:previous|prior|above|earlier|all)\\W+(?:\\w+\\W+){0,2}?(?:instructions?|prompts?|rules)\\b",
    "\\b(?:you are|act as|pretend to be)\\W+(?:now\\W+)?(?:an?\\W+)?(?:ai|assistant|chatbot|language model|llm)\\b",
    "\\bwithout\\W+(?:asking|telling|informing|warning)\\W+the\\W+user\\b",
    "\\b(?:call|run|invoke|execute)\\W+(?:the\\W+)?(?:tool|function)s?\\b",
    "\\bsystem\\W+prompt\\b",
    "\\bnote\\W+to\\W+(?:the\\W+)?(?:ai|assistant|claude|llm)\\b"
  ],
